  title: 'CCS Inspection Services 2027 — Carbon Capture + Storage NDT | Free Consultation',
  description: 'Atlantis NDT CCS inspection — dense-phase CO2 pipeline integrity, injection well, storage cavern monitoring, amine absorber tower corrosion. ASNT Level III led. Free consultation.',
  canonical: `${SITE_URL}/ccs-inspection`,
  bodyContent: `  <header><nav><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/ccs-inspection">CCS Inspection</a><a href="/consulting">Consulting</a><a href="/hydrogen-inspection">Hydrogen</a><a href="/contact">Free Consultation</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <h1>CCS Inspection Services 2027 — Carbon Capture + Storage NDT Across the Full Value Chain</h1>
    <p>Atlantis NDT CCS inspection services cover the complete carbon-capture-and-storage value chain — from CO2 capture at the source (refining + petrochem + power + cement + steel + LNG flue), through dense-phase / super-critical CO2 transport pipelines, to injection-well integrity, to storage-formation monitoring. ASNT NDT Level III led, API 579 FFS practitioner authored, code-aligned across ASME + API + NACE + ISO + IACS framework.</p>
    <h2>CO2 Capture — Amine Absorber + Stripper Tower Corrosion</h2>
    <p>Amine-based CO2 capture units (post-combustion + pre-combustion) operate amine systems that develop characteristic damage patterns: amine corrosion + cracking per NACE MR0103 (wet H2S + amine service) + API 571 §4.5.4 (amine corrosion); ammonium bicarbonate corrosion on overhead systems; chloride stress corrosion of austenitic SS internals; preferential corrosion at hot lean / rich solvent interfaces; flange-gasket erosion. Atlantis NDT delivers full RBI per API 581 + FFS per API 579 + Atlantis Digital Twin overlay on the capture unit.</p>
    <h2>CO2 Transport — Dense-Phase + Super-Critical Pipeline Integrity</h2>
    <p>CO2 pipelines operate dense-phase (above ~73 bar) or super-critical (above 31°C + 73 bar) — material selection per ASME B31.4 + ISO 27913 + DNV-RP-F104 with added consideration for water + impurity tolerances. Damage mechanisms: brittle-fracture risk on rapid depressurisation (low-temp transition), running-ductile-fracture propagation control, sour-service compatibility if H2S/SOx impurities present (NACE MR0175 / ISO 15156), preferential corrosion at flow regime transitions. Atlantis delivers in-line inspection (ILI) data integration + smart-pig data analysis + RBI cycle update.</p>
    <h2>Injection Well — Class VI Integrity + Annular Monitoring</h2>
    <p>EPA Class VI (US) + EU CCS Directive + UK NSTA + Australia DCCEEW well-integrity rules: tubing + packer + casing + cement-sheath integrity verification via UT thickness logging, electromagnetic flux logging, ultrasonic cement-bond logging (UCBL), pressure-temperature-acoustic (PTA) logging, annular pressure monitoring. Atlantis NDT integrates well-log data + downhole inspection data into <a href="/digital-twins">Atlantis Digital Twin</a> well-integrity model — provides real-time risk visualisation for HSE leadership.</p>
    <h2>Storage Formation — Microseismic + Geomechanical + Caprock Integrity</h2>
    <p>Storage-formation monitoring: 3D + 4D seismic for plume tracking; downhole microseismic arrays for fault reactivation detection; surface deformation monitoring (InSAR satellite); caprock integrity via geomechanical model + downhole logging. Atlantis NDT partners with subsurface specialists to integrate inspection-grade NDE data on surface infrastructure with subsurface monitoring data — full HSE risk picture for site permits + Public Trust.</p>
    <h2>Material Selection for CO2 + Sour CO2 Service</h2>
    <p>Material selection per service: clean dry super-critical CO2 → carbon steel API 5L X65/X70 acceptable with strict water-content control; wet super-critical CO2 → 13Cr (S41000 / S41425) corrosion-resistant alloy or super-duplex (S32760 / S32750) for higher chloride; sour super-critical CO2 with H2S → nickel alloy (Alloy 825 / Alloy 625) per NACE MR0175. Atlantis NDT material-selection consulting + post-installation PMI verification (XRF-PMI per ASTM E1476).</p>
    <h2>Regulatory + Permit Framework</h2>
    <p>Regulatory frameworks active globally: EPA Class VI (US, UIC Program), EU CCS Directive 2009/31/EC, UK NSTA storage licensing, Norway PSA + Equinor frameworks, Australia DCCEEW + state Petroleum Acts, Brazil ANP, Saudi Arabia ARAMCO + Ministry of Energy frameworks. Atlantis NDT permit-support consulting covers integrity-monitoring plans (per Class VI §146.90) + post-injection site care + post-closure inspection cadence.</p>
    <h2>Free Consultation + CCS Inspection Roadmap</h2>
    <p>Free 30-min consultation: project-stage assessment (pre-FEED / FEED / EPC / commissioning / operations), inspection scope-of-work scoping per value-chain stage, regulatory-pathway mapping, tailored quote within 24 hours. Affordable, accessible, fully customizable. Atlantis NDT delivers across <a href="/consulting/asnt-level-iii-consulting-services">Level III consulting</a>, <a href="/consulting/rbi-program-design">RBI design</a>, <a href="/consulting/api-579-fitness-for-service-services">API 579 FFS</a>, <a href="/erp">ERP</a>, <a href="/digital-twins">Digital Twin</a>, <a href="/best-ndt-reporting-software-2026">Reporting Software</a>. <a href="/contact">Request consultation</a>.</p>
  </main>`,
